# Optional tier map read by lib/classify.sh (CLASSIFY_TIERS_FILE).
# Copy this to devbrain-classify.tiers (same directory) and edit it if you want
# per-project overrides of the default classification.
#
# Format: <absolute-path-prefix>=<tier>
# Tiers: personal | business-confidential | interno-devbrain | publico
#
# Anything not listed here falls through to the fail-closed default in
# lib/classify.sh (business-confidential) — this file only lets you loosen or
# tighten specific paths on purpose.
#
# Examples (edit or remove):
# /Users/you/dev/projects/my-open-source-repo=publico
# /Users/you/dev/projects/my-client-project=business-confidential
